d with emotion and wonder. From timeless waltzes to soul-stirring classics, this landmark anniversary concert promises an evening of passion, joy, and togetherness. Be part of this historic celebration as the Vrijthof once again transforms into a breathtaking open-air ballroom — only in cinemas this summer.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"This year, André Rieu celebrates a spectacular milestone — the 20th anniversary of his iconic summer concerts on the magnificent Vrijthof square.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":165,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000335\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000336\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000055\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a73b32c9-cde1-4f0c-9969-473043393c2b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008932\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010077\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"PIECE OF MAGIC\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"HO00000335\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"André\",\"familyName\":\"Rieu\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000336\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"The Johann Strauss\",\"familyName\":\"Orchestra\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\":\"0000000055\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Music\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":null}],\"censorRatings\":[{\"id\":\"0000000010\",\"classification\":{\"text\":\"TBC\",\"translations\":[]},\"classificationDescription\":{\"text\":\"To be confirmed\",\"translations\":[]},\"ageRestriction\":{\"minimumAge\":0}}],\"attributes\":[{\"id\":\"0000000178\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Event Cinema\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"EventCinem\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":null,\"importantMessage\":null,\"displayPriority\":8,\"isPromoted\":true},{\"id\":\"0000000030\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Wheelchair Accessible\",\"translations